        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: 1955 Mississippi State Maroons football team; 1955 Florida Gators football team\n- People: Darrell Royal\n- Organizations: Mississippi State College; Washington\n- Events: 1955 college football season\n\nFacts:\n- The 1955 Mississippi State Maroons football team represented Mississippi State College during the 1955 college football season.\n- In the 1955 season, the 1955 Florida Gators football team had conference victories over the Mississippi State Maroons by 20–14, the LSU Tigers by 18–14, and the Georgia Bulldogs by 19–13.\n- After the 1955 season, head coach Darrell Royal left the 1955 Mississippi State Maroons football team to take the job at Washington.\n- Darrell K Royal was an American football player and coach who was born on July 6, 1924, and died on November 7, 2012.",
